Package: CleanLASA
Title: Import and Clean LASA SPSS Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Bram", "Hoogerheide", , "b.hoogerheide@vu.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for importing and cleaning data from the Longitudinal
    Aging Study Amsterdam (LASA). Applies SPSS variable- and value-labels
    from LASA documentation across waves, provides a wrapper function to
    automatically detect and import LASA datafiles, and reports variables
    that could not be matched to their corresponding documentation.
